    "cons": [
      "Heavy, at 140 lb per DeWalt Canada",
      "Expensive, $1,249.99 on one listing",
      "Too much pressure for soft concrete with narrow tips"
    ],
    "bottomLine": "For large driveways and big slabs, the DeWalt DXPW4440 delivers 4,400 PSI and 4.0 GPM from a Honda GX390 and triplex pump, per DeWalt, enough to run a large surface cleaner."
